PRIVACY POLICY


Kido Admin ("we", "our", "the app") is developed by [Kido Admin / LITZTECH]. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

- Account information: email address, name and a unique user ID when you sign up or log in.
- App content: data you create or save inside the app, stored in our database (Cloud Firestore).
- Usage and device data: app interactions, device model, operating system version and similar diagnostics, collected through Firebase Analytics.

2. HOW WE USE INFORMATION

- To create and manage your account and provide app features.
- To store and sync your data.
- To understand how the app is used, fix bugs and improve it.

3. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

We use Google Firebase services (Authentication, Cloud Firestore and Analytics). These services may process your data under their own privacy policies:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

4. DATA SHARING

We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with the service providers listed above, or when required by law.

5. DATA RETENTION AND DELETION

We keep your data while your account is active. To request deletion of your account and data, email us at surya.litztech@gmail.com .

6. SECURITY

We use reasonable measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure.

7. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

The app is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

8. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY

We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be posted on this page.

